{"version":1,"id":"matematicas-2003-reserva-4","asignatura":"matematicas","anio":2003,"convocatoria":"Reserva 4","documento":"MAT-2003-RESERVA-4.pdf","ejercicios":[{"id":"matematicas-2003-reserva-4-1","n":1,"num":1,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Sea la función \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) definida por \\[f(x)=\\begin{cases}x^2+3&\\text{si }x\\leq1\\\\2-x^2&\\text{si }x\\gt1\\end{cases}\\]","apartados":["(1,25 p.) Calcula, si es posible, las derivadas laterales de \\(f\\) en \\(x=1\\).","(1,25 p.) Halla los intervalos de crecimiento y de decrecimiento de la función \\(f\\)."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(f(1)=1+3=4\\). Por la izquierda (mismo trozo que \\(f(1)\\)):</p>\\[f'(1^-)=\\lim_{h\\to0^-}\\frac{(1+h)^2+3-4}{h}=\\lim_{h\\to0^-}\\frac{2h+h^2}h=2\\]<p>Por la derecha:</p>\\[f'(1^+)=\\lim_{h\\to0^+}\\frac{2-(1+h)^2-4}{h}=\\lim_{h\\to0^+}\\frac{-3-2h-h^2}h=\\frac{-3}{0^+}=-\\infty\\]<div class='res'>\\(f'(1^-)=2\\); la derivada por la derecha no existe (el cociente tiende a \\(-\\infty\\): \\(f\\) tiene un salto en \\(x=1\\))</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(x=1\\) es un punto «problemático»<i class='n' data-t='why'>Los puntos «problemáticos» son los que no pertenecen al dominio (por ejemplo, los que anulan un denominador) y los puntos donde cambia la expresión de una función a trozos. Hay que marcarlos en la recta porque en ellos también puede cambiar el signo de la derivada.</i>. \\(f'(x)=2x\\) si \\(x\\lt1\\) (se anula en \\(\\boxed{x=0}\\)) y \\(f'(x)=-2x\\lt0\\) si \\(x\\gt1\\). Signo de \\(f'\\)<i class='n' data-t='tp'>Dentro de cada intervalo la derivada no cambia de signo, así que basta sustituir un valor cualquiera del intervalo para conocer su signo.</i>:</p><div class='rs' style='overflow-x:auto;margin:.35rem 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 274 108' width='100%' style='max-width:329px;display:block;margin:auto' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='14.5' fill='currentColor'><path d='M14 52H260' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M96 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='96' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>0</text><path d='M178 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='178' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>1</text><text x='29.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M43.0 10L79.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M70.0 39L79.0 40L77.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='55.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(−1) &lt; 0</text><text x='111.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M125.0 40L161.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M152.0 11L161.0 10L159.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='137.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(½) &gt; 0</text><text x='193.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M207.0 10L243.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M234.0 39L243.0 40L241.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='219.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(2) &lt; 0</text></svg></div><p>\\(f\\) decrece en \\((-\\infty,0)\\) debido a que \\(f'(x)\\lt0\\), crece en \\((0,1)\\) debido a que \\(f'(x)\\gt0\\), y decrece en \\((1,+\\infty)\\) debido a que \\(f'(x)\\lt0\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Si \\(f'\\gt0\\) en un intervalo, \\(f\\) crece en él; si \\(f'\\lt0\\), decrece.</i>.</p><div class='res'>Decrece en \\((-\\infty,0)\\) y en \\((1,+\\infty)\\); crece en \\((0,1)\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='why'>Como \\(f(1)=4\\) y a la derecha \\(f\\) vale menos de 1, en \\(x=1\\) hay un salto hacia abajo: los intervalos se dan por separado.</i></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"funciones","tipo":"cont","apartados":"a"},{"tema":"funciones","tipo":"mono","apartados":"b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2003-RESERVA-4.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2003-reserva-4-2","n":2,"num":2,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Determina el valor positivo de \\(\\lambda\\) para el que el área del recinto limitado por la parábola \\(y=x^2\\) y la recta \\(y=\\lambda x\\) es 1.","apartados":[]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Resolución","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Cortes: \\(x^2=\\lambda x\\iff x=0\\) o \\(x=\\lambda\\). Entre ellos, con \\(\\lambda\\gt0\\), la recta va por encima:</p>\\[A=\\int_0^\\lambda(\\lambda x-x^2)\\,dx=\\Bigl[\\frac{\\lambda x^2}2-\\frac{x^3}3\\Bigr]_0^\\lambda=\\frac{\\lambda^3}6=1\\iff\\lambda^3=6\\]<div class='res'>\\(\\lambda=\\sqrt[3]6\\approx1{,}82\\)</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"integ","tipo":"area","apartados":""},{"tema":"integ","tipo":"def","apartados":""}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2003-RESERVA-4.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2003-reserva-4-3","n":3,"num":3,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Considera el sistema de ecuaciones: \\[\\begin{cases}x+my-z=-2+2my\\\\mx-y+4z=5+2z\\\\6x-10y-z=-1\\end{cases}\\]","apartados":["(1,5 p.) Discute las soluciones del sistema según los valores de \\(m\\).","(1 p.) Resuelve el sistema cuando sea compatible indeterminado."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Paso todo al primer miembro: \\(x-my-z=-2\\), \\(mx-y+2z=5\\), \\(6x-10y-z=-1\\).</p>\\[A^*=\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1&-m&-1&-2\\\\m&-1&2&5\\\\6&-10&-1&-1\\end{array}\\right)\\]<p>Uso el teorema de Rouché-Frobenius<i class='n' data-t='th'>Rouché-Frobenius: el sistema es compatible si y solo si \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=\\operatorname{rg}A^*\\); determinado si ese rango es el número de incógnitas, indeterminado si es menor.</i>. Por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}1&-m&-1\\\\m&-1&2\\\\6&-10&-1\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(1- 12 m+10 m\\bigr)-\\bigl(6-20+m^{2}\\bigr)\\]\\[=-m^2-2m+15=-(m-3)(m+5)\\]<p><b>• Si </b>\\(m\\neq3,-5\\)<b>:</b> compatible determinado.</p><p><b>• Si </b>\\(m=-5\\)<b>:</b> \\(\\begin{vmatrix}1&5\\\\-5&-1\\end{vmatrix}=24\\neq0\\): \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=2\\). Menor de \\(A^*\\) de las columnas 1, 2 y 4:</p>\\[\\begin{vmatrix}1&5&-2\\\\-5&-1&5\\\\6&-10&-1\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(1+150-100\\bigr)-\\bigl(12-50+25\\bigr)\\]\\[=64\\neq0\\]<p>\\(\\operatorname{rg}A^*=3\\): <b>incompatible</b>.</p><p><b>• Si </b>\\(m=3\\)<b>:</b> \\(\\begin{vmatrix}1&-3\\\\3&-1\\end{vmatrix}=8\\neq0\\): \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=2\\). Menor de \\(A^*\\) de las columnas 1, 2 y 4:</p>\\[\\begin{vmatrix}1&-3&-2\\\\3&-1&5\\\\6&-10&-1\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(1-90+60\\bigr)-\\bigl(12-50+9\\bigr)\\]\\[=0\\]<p>\\(\\operatorname{rg}A^*=2\\): <b>compatible indeterminado</b>.</p><div class='res'>Si \\(m\\neq3,-5\\): compatible determinado. Si \\(m=3\\): compatible indeterminado. Si \\(m=-5\\): incompatible</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Con \\(m=3\\): \\(x-3y-z=-2\\), \\(3x-y+2z=5\\). Con \\(z=t\\): \\(x-3y=-2+t\\), \\(3x-y=5-2t\\). </p><p>Lo resuelvo por la regla de Cramer<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Cramer: si \\(|A|\\neq0\\), cada incógnita es el cociente entre el determinante que resulta de sustituir su columna por la de los términos independientes y el determinante \\(|A|\\) de la matriz de coeficientes.</i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}1&-3\\\\3&-1\\end{vmatrix}=8\\]\\[x=\\frac{\\begin{vmatrix}t - 2&-3\\\\5 - 2 t&-1\\end{vmatrix}}{8}=\\frac{17 - 7 t}{8}=\\frac{17}{8} - \\frac{7 t}{8}\\]\\[y=\\frac{\\begin{vmatrix}1&t - 2\\\\3&5 - 2 t\\end{vmatrix}}{8}=\\frac{11 - 5 t}{8}=\\frac{11}{8} - \\frac{5 t}{8}\\]<div class='res'>\\(x=\\dfrac{17-7t}8,\\ y=\\dfrac{11-5t}8,\\ z=t\\), con \\(t\\in\\mathbb R\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Con \\(t=-1\\): \\((3,2,-1)\\); en la 3.ª, \\(18-20+1=-1\\) ✓.</i></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"sistemas","tipo":"disc","apartados":"a"},{"tema":"sistemas","tipo":"res","apartados":"b"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2003-RESERVA-4.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2003-reserva-4-4","n":4,"num":4,"bloque":"Opción A","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Se sabe que el plano \\(\\Pi\\) corta a los semiejes positivos de coordenadas en los puntos \\(A\\), \\(B\\) y \\(C\\), siendo las longitudes de los segmentos \\(OA\\), \\(OB\\) y \\(OC\\) de 4 unidades, donde \\(O\\) es el origen de coordenadas.","apartados":["(0,75 p.) Halla la ecuación del plano \\(\\Pi\\).","(1 p.) Calcula el área del triángulo \\(ABC\\).","(0,75 p.) Obtén un plano paralelo al plano \\(\\Pi\\) que diste 4 unidades del origen de coordenadas."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'><p>\\(A(4,0,0)\\), \\(B(0,4,0)\\), \\(C(0,0,4)\\). \\(\\overrightarrow{AB}=(-4,4,0)\\), \\(\\overrightarrow{AC}=(-4,0,4)\\), y \\(\\overrightarrow{AB}\\times\\overrightarrow{AC}=(16,16,16)\\parallel(1,1,1)\\). Plano \\(x+y+z+D=0\\) por \\(A\\): \\(4+D=0\\iff D=-4\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(\\Pi\\equiv x+y+z-4=0\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'>\\[\\text{Área}=\\frac12\\left|\\overrightarrow{AB}\\times\\overrightarrow{AC}\\right|=\\frac12\\sqrt{3\\cdot16^2}=8\\sqrt3\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":45,\"el\":36,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[4,0,0],[0,4,0],[0,0,4]],\"#f59e0b\",\"#b45309\"],[\"line\",[0,0,0],[5.2,0.0,0.0],\"#94a3b8\",1.4,false],[\"txt\",[5.2,0.0,0.0],\"X\",\"#94a3b8\",6,0],[\"line\",[0,0,0],[0.0,5.2,0.0],\"#94a3b8\",1.4,false],[\"txt\",[0.0,5.2,0.0],\"Y\",\"#94a3b8\",6,0],[\"line\",[0,0,0],[0.0,0.0,5.2],\"#94a3b8\",1.4,false],[\"txt\",[0.0,0.0,5.2],\"Z\",\"#94a3b8\",6,0],[\"pt\",[4,0,0],\"A\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[0,4,0],\"B\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[0,0,4],\"C\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m03r4a4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m03r4a4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m03r4a4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m03r4a4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='56.4,228.1 258.9,228.1 157.6,52.8' fill='#f59e0b' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#b45309' stroke-width='1.2'/><line x1='157.6' y1='168.6' x2='26.0' y2='246.0' stroke='#94a3b8' stroke-width='1.4'/><text x='32.0' y='246.0' fill='#94a3b8' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>X</text><line x1='157.6' y1='168.6' x2='289.3' y2='246.0' stroke='#94a3b8' stroke-width='1.4'/><text x='295.3' y='246.0' fill='#94a3b8' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>Y</text><line x1='157.6' y1='168.6' x2='157.6' y2='18.0' stroke='#94a3b8' stroke-width='1.4'/><text x='163.6' y='18.0' fill='#94a3b8' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>Z</text><circle cx='56.4' cy='228.1' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='63.4' y='222.1' font-weight='700'>A</text><circle cx='258.9' cy='228.1' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='265.9' y='222.1' font-weight='700'>B</text><circle cx='157.6' cy='52.8' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='164.6' y='46.8' font-weight='700'>C</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='12.7' y2='276.7' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='5.7' y='283.0' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='35.3' y2='276.7' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='36.3' y='283.0' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='257.1' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='256.5' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>Área \\(=8\\sqrt3\\approx13{,}86\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado c","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Un plano paralelo es \\(x+y+z+D=0\\). Su distancia al origen<i class='n' data-t='fm'>\\(d(P,\\pi)=\\dfrac{|Ax_0+By_0+Cz_0+D|}{\\sqrt{A^2+B^2+C^2}}\\)</i> es \\(\\frac{|D|}{\\sqrt3}=4\\iff D=\\pm4\\sqrt3\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(x+y+z-4\\sqrt3=0\\) (o \\(x+y+z+4\\sqrt3=0\\))</div></div>"}],"clasificacion":[{"tema":"geom","tipo":"ecs","apartados":"a, c"},{"tema":"geom","tipo":"area","apartados":"b"},{"tema":"geom","tipo":"dist","apartados":"c"}],"origen":{"documento":"MAT-2003-RESERVA-4.pdf"},"dificultad":null,"etiquetas":[],"revision":"borrador"},{"id":"matematicas-2003-reserva-4-5","n":5,"num":1,"bloque":"Opción B","puntos":"2,5","enunciado":{"intro":"Sea \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) la función definida por \\(f(x)=\\sqrt[3]x\\).","apartados":["(0,5 p.) Calcula la recta tangente a la gráfica de \\(f\\) en el punto de abscisa \\(x=1\\).","(0,5 p.) Esboza el recinto limitado por la gráfica de \\(f\\) y la recta tangente obtenida.","(1,5 p.) Calcula el área del recinto descrito en el apartado anterior."]},"solucion":[{"titulo":"Apartado a","html":"<div class='ex'>\\[f(1)=1,\\qquad f'(x)=\\frac1{3\\sqrt[3]{x^2}}\\Rightarrow f'(1)=\\frac13,\\qquad y-1=\\frac13(x-1)\\]<div class='res'>\\(y=\\dfrac{x+2}3\\)</div></div>"},{"titulo":"Apartado b","html":"<div class='ex'><p>Cortes: \\(\\sqrt[3]x=\\frac{x+2}3\\). Con \\(t=\\sqrt[3]x\\): \\(3t=t^3+2\\iff t^3-3t+2=0\\iff(t-1)^2(t+2)=0\\), así que \\(t=1\\) o \\(t=-2\\), es decir, \\(x=1\\) o \\(x=-8\\).</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 180' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='42.6,142.9 44.3,142.1 46.0,141.2 47.7,140.4 49.4,139.5 51.1,138.7 52.8,137.8 54.5,137.0 56.2,136.1 57.9,135.2 59.6,134.4 61.3,133.5 63.0,132.7 64.7,131.8 66.3,131.0 68.0,130.1 69.7,129.3 71.4,128.4 73.1,127.6 74.8,126.7 76.5,125.9 78.2,125.0 79.9,124.1 81.6,123.3 83.3,122.4 85.0,121.6 86.7,120.7 88.4,119.9 90.1,119.0 91.8,118.2 93.5,117.3 95.2,116.5 96.9,115.6 98.6,114.8 100.3,113.9 102.0,113.0 103.7,112.2 105.3,111.3 107.0,110.5 108.7,109.6 110.4,108.8 112.1,107.9 113.8,107.1 115.5,106.2 117.2,105.4 118.9,104.5 120.6,103.7 122.3,102.8 124.0,102.0 125.7,101.1 127.4,100.2 129.1,99.4 130.8,98.5 132.5,97.7 134.2,96.8 135.9,96.0 137.6,95.1 139.3,94.3 141.0,93.4 142.7,92.6 144.3,91.7 146.0,90.9 147.7,90.0 149.4,89.1 151.1,88.3 152.8,87.4 154.5,86.6 156.2,85.7 157.9,84.9 159.6,84.0 161.3,83.2 163.0,82.3 164.7,81.5 166.4,80.6 168.1,79.8 169.8,78.9 171.5,78.0 173.2,77.2 174.9,76.3 176.6,75.5 178.3,74.6 180.0,73.8 181.7,72.9 183.3,72.1 185.0,71.2 186.7,70.4 188.4,69.5 190.1,68.7 191.8,67.8 193.5,67.0 195.2,66.1 196.9,65.2 198.6,64.4 200.3,63.5 202.0,62.7 203.7,61.8 205.4,61.0 207.1,60.1 208.8,59.3 210.5,58.4 212.2,57.6 213.9,56.7 215.6,55.9 217.3,55.0 219.0,54.1 220.7,53.3 222.3,52.4 224.0,51.6 225.7,50.7 227.4,49.9 229.1,49.0 230.8,48.2 232.5,47.3 234.2,46.5 235.9,45.6 237.6,44.8 239.3,43.9 241.0,43.0 242.7,42.2 244.4,41.3 246.1,40.5 246.1,40.5 244.4,41.4 242.7,42.3 241.0,43.3 239.3,44.3 237.6,45.4 235.9,46.7 234.2,48.0 232.5,49.5 230.8,51.2 229.1,53.1 227.4,55.5 225.7,58.8 224.0,64.6 222.3,87.2 220.7,91.7 219.0,94.6 217.3,96.8 215.6,98.7 213.9,100.3 212.2,101.7 210.5,103.0 208.8,104.2 207.1,105.3 2